0.12: Initial demo
0.13: Added bitfont rendering
0.14: Disabled widgets drawing
0.15: Shared game state, swipe/tap/button input via setUI, fixed crashes, minimap rebuilt per map
0.16: Text renders pixel for pixel like the original (alignment, kerning, missing glyphs, red text when badly hurt)
0.17: Saves the game (on map change and when closing the app) and continues it on the next start
0.18: Chests with their treasure, resting on hay bales, bone piles and locked doors stay burned/unlocked
0.19: Info screen (tap or button): equipment, HP/MP, gold, minimap; cast Heal, Burn and Unlock outside combat
0.20: Combat: random encounters and mimics, attack, run, Heal/Burn/Unlock, enemy powers, victory with gold, defeat and respawn
0.21: The Death Speaker boss: Bone Shield (absorbs attacks, broken by Burn), its tile clears once defeated
0.22: Shops and dialogs: buy weapons, armor and spells, rest at the inn, talk to the villagers, the demo ends at Stonegate
0.23: Title screen with Start/Continue and Options (animations, vibration, minimap); a new game opens with the nightmare
0.24: Vibration patterns instead of the original's sound effects; README with controls
